        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ops_box" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;⚙️ MINIKUBE PLATFORM CLI &amp; OPERATIONAL LIFECYCLE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Unified Orchestrator:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\platform-minikube.ps1 up&lt;/code&gt; (Minikube, Istio, ArgoCD, Prometheus, Vault, Keycloak, Apps &amp; Tunnels; options: &lt;code&gt;-WithoutIstio&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;-SkipScans&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tag Synchronization:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\platform-minikube.ps1 set-tag -ImageTag &amp;lt;tag&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; (Automated &lt;code&gt;yq&lt;/code&gt; updates across Helm values protecting 3rd-party images).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Quality Gates &amp; Tests:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\platform-minikube.ps1 test&lt;/code&gt; (Maven/Java 21) &amp; &lt;code&gt;security-scan&lt;/code&gt; (5 gates: Gitleaks, TFLint, Trivy, Conftest, Cosign cosign.pub).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Fast Resume (&amp;lt; 30s):&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\platform-minikube.ps1 start&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;up -Fast&lt;/code&gt; (Resumes pods, NodePorts &amp; tunnels bypassing redundant scans and Helm re-runs).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Health Doctor &amp; Endpoints:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\platform-minikube.ps1 doctor&lt;/code&gt; (Pod, NodePort &amp; OPA health); &lt;code&gt;.\platform-minikube.ps1 urls&lt;/code&gt; (Active service endpoints &amp; credentials).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Teardown &amp; Purge:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;.\platform-minikube.ps1 down&lt;/code&gt; (Safe pause) or &lt;code&gt;down -Destroy&lt;/code&gt; (Purges VM, volumes &amp; cluster state)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=11.5;align=left;spacingLeft=20;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="590" width="1780" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
